{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311600","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231160001:1":{"text":"어떻게 이렇게 습할 수 있는지 모르겠어.","source_cn":"真不知道这里怎么会这么潮湿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DDE7B399644227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231160002:1":{"text":"매일 밤 침대에 누우면 물먹은 스펀지에 누워있는 느낌이 들어.","source_cn":"每天晚上躺在床上，我感觉自己好像躺在吸满水的海绵里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7151AE7D9B3FBD1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231160003:1":{"text":"뒤척이면 침대에서 물이 나올 것 같아서 뒤척이지도 못하겠다고!","source_cn":"我甚至不敢翻身，因为我不确定转身之后，床上会不会被我压出水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C657455105A3483","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅行家文斯":{"text":"여행가 빈스","source":"旅行家文斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}